{"body":{"asks":"Whether a whole is taken away as a store of its own by copying its store's files whole, every block, log and history, and then one act in each store letting go of what is the other's, the new store given its own root; letting go from one store alone being the act this is.","raised":[{"$ref":"1M75J9GF9RQH037"}],"stands":"leaning"},"id":"1M75J9HFP290000","instance":["1M6YBY3G000001E"],"name":"Taking a whole away","prev":null}
